<%@ page pageEncoding="UTF-8" %>
<div class="detail-top"><a class="text-link" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/app/${storeMode ? 'history' : 'orders'}">← 목록으로</a></div><section class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><h2>PO-<fmt:formatNumber value="${order.id}" pattern="00000000"/> <span class="status"><c:out value="${order.status}"/></span></h2><p><fmt:formatDate value="${order.created_at}" pattern="yyyy.MM.dd HH:mm"/> 접수</p></div><div class="actions"><c:if test="${!storeMode && (order.status == '접수' || order.status == '부분 출고')}"><a class="button primary" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/app/edit?action=ship&id=${order.id}">출고 등록</a></c:if><c:if test="${!storeMode && (order.status == '출고 완료' || order.status == '부분 출고')}"><a class="button" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/app/edit?action=return&id=${order.id}">반품 등록</a></c:if></div></div><div class="detail-info"><div><small>발주 매장</small><strong><c:out value="${order.store_name}"/></strong></div><div><small>담당자</small><strong><c:out value="${order.actor_name}"/></strong></div><div><small>요청사항</small><strong><c:out value="${order.note}" default="없음"/></strong></div><div><small>발주 금액</small><strong><fmt:formatNumber value="${orderTotal}" maxFractionDigits="2"/>원</strong></div></div><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>세부번호</th><th>상품</th><th>확정 단가</th><th>발주</th><th>출고</th><th>미출고</th><th>반품</th><th>금액</th></tr></thead><tbody><c:forEach items="${lines}" var="l"><tr><td><fmt:formatNumber value="${l.line_no}" pattern="000"/></td><td><c:out value="${l.product_name}"/></td><td><fmt:formatNumber value="${l.unit_price}" maxFractionDigits="2"/>원</td><td>${l.quantity}</td><td>${l.shipped}</td><td>${l.remaining}</td><td>${l.returned}</td><td><fmt:formatNumber value="${l.total}" maxFractionDigits="2"/>원</td></tr></c:forEach></tbody></table></div></section>
<c:if test="${order.status == '접수' && (!storeMode || canOrder)}"><section class="panel secondary-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><h2>발주 취소</h2><p>출고 전 발주만 취소할 수 있습니다. 취소 시 재고는 변경되지 않습니다.</p></div></div><form class="filter-bar" action="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/app/save" method="post" data-confirm="이 발주를 취소하시겠습니까?"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="${sessionScope.csrf}"><input type="hidden" name="requestToken" value="${requestToken}"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="cancel"><input type="hidden" name="order_id" value="${order.id}"><label class="search-label">취소 사유<input name="note" required maxlength="1000" placeholder="취소 사유를 입력하세요"></label><button class="button danger">발주 취소</button></form></section></c:if>
<c:if test="${order.status == '취소'}"><div class="notice">취소 사유: <c:out value="${order.cancel_reason}"/></div></c:if>
<section class="panel secondary-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><h2>출고 이력</h2></div><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>출고번호</th><th>출고일</th><th>상품</th><th>수량</th><th>담당자</th><th>메모</th></tr></thead><tbody><c:forEach items="${shipments}" var="s"><tr><td>SH-${s.id}</td><td><c:out value="${s.occurred_on}"/></td><td><c:out value="${s.product_name}"/></td><td>${s.quantity}</td><td><c:out value="${s.actor_name}"/></td><td><c:out value="${s.note}"/></td></tr></c:forEach></tbody></table><c:if test="${empty shipments}"><div class="empty-state">아직 출고 이력이 없습니다.</div></c:if></div></section>
<section class="panel secondary-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><h2>반품 이력</h2></div><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>등록일</th><th>상품</th><th>반품 수량</th><th>반품 금액</th><th>재입고</th><th>사유</th></tr></thead><tbody><c:forEach items="${returns}" var="r"><tr><td><fmt:formatDate value="${r.created_at}" pattern="yyyy.MM.dd HH:mm"/></td><td><c:out value="${r.product_name}"/></td><td>${r.quantity}</td><td><fmt:formatNumber value="${r.total}" maxFractionDigits="2"/>원</td><td>${r.restock ? '반영' : '미반영'}</td><td><c:out value="${r.reason}"/></td></tr></c:forEach></tbody></table><c:if test="${empty returns}"><div class="empty-state">반품 이력이 없습니다.</div></c:if></div></section><p class="muted">발주 단가는 접수 시점의 가격으로 보존됩니다. 출고가 시작되면 발주 취소는 불가합니다.</p>